d 'STATA-MCP': Stata MCP (dev) — drone, Go server, and ado command suite
d
d Development build of the Stata MCP project: the MCP server is the Go
d binary (stata-mcp-server) instead of the server jar. The binary is not
d part of this package — run mcp_setup after install to fetch it.
d
d Author: mhjung0822
d Support: https://github.com/mhjung0822/stata-mcp-dev
d Distribution-Date: 20261111
d
d Requires: Stata 17 or higher (18+ recommended; bundled Java is used for the drone)

F stata-drone.jar
F mcp_connect.ado
F mcp_server.ado
F llm.ado
F graph_meta_put.ado
F mcp_load_serset.ado
F mcp.ado
F mcp.dlg
F mcp_menu.ado
F mcp_setup.ado
F mcp_uninstall.ado
F mcp_watchdog.ado
F mcp_analysis_setup.ado
F mcp_proc.ado
